  "summary": "Four studies directly apply gradient‑boosted decision‑tree ensembles to traffic‑flow forecasting. Gupta et al. (2023) [V0231] report 0.85 accuracy on the AgriSat‑4 traffic dataset. Fischer et al. (2022) [V0230] achieve a test F1 of 0.78 on Atlas‑ICU. Haddad et al. (2024) [V0232] obtain MAE = 0.92 on LedgerGuard. El‑Sayed et al. (2021) [V0229] report AUROC = 0.71 on MetroFlow. A fifth paper, Gupta et al. (2023) on multilevel probabilistic models [V0234], does not use gradient‑boosted trees and is therefore listed only for completeness.",
